[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

; THE DIVER — built to the language of drone_variant_02_interceptor.glb, which
; is the quadcopter already flying in this game.
;
; What that asset does and this now copies: HEXAGONAL DUCTED ROTOR RINGS on
; swept arms rather than bare discs, a rectangular slab hull with a recessed
; panel, charcoal grey throughout, and RED accents on the rotor hubs and nose.
;
; Red, not amber. The first pass used amber, which is the mechanic's welder and
; the reclaimer — it read as repair. The interceptor's own accent is red, so
; that is the established colour for "this is a hostile drone" and it costs
; nothing to match.
;
; The warhead is the one thing the interceptor does not have, and it is the
; whole point of this frame: a blunt cone slung under the hull where the bomber
; carries its bomb, visible from below, which is the only angle you get.

